<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>PM Intelligence Pack — Sistem Kerja Lengkap untuk Product Manager</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Bukan template kosong. Sistem kerja PM dari pengalaman nyata di 4 industri: Kementerian, Microfinance, Ecommerce, Edtech. PRD Generator, Research Synthesis, Stakeholder Deck, Competitor Framework." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --ink: #0f0f0f;
      --ink-soft: #3a3a3a;
      --ink-muted: #767676;
      --paper: #faf9f7;
      --paper-warm: #f3f0eb;
      --accent: #1a4fff;
      --accent-light: #e8eeff;
      --gold: #c9a84c;
      --gold-light: #fdf6e3;
      --border: #e2ddd7;
      --radius: 12px;
      --radius-lg: 20px;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(250,249,247,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 14px 24px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
      padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none; transition: opacity .2s;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { opacity: .8; }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px 64px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: var(--gold-light);
      border: 1px solid #e8d5a3;
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
      color: #7a5c1e;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .hero-badge::before { content: '✦'; }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero h1 em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto 40px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
      padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none; transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .15s;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.15); }
    .btn-secondary {
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      padding: 14px 20px;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .hero-proof {
      margin-top: 40px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .proof-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-muted);
    }
    .proof-item::before { content: '✓'; color: #22a06b; font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── SEPARATOR ── */
    .sep { height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 0 24px; }

    /* ── PROBLEM SECTION ── */
    .section { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 24px; }
    .section-label {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .section-sub {
      font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink-soft);
      max-width: 580px; line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .pain-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .pain-card {
      background: var(--paper-warm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .pain-card .icon { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .pain-card h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .pain-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── DIFFERENTIATOR ── */
    .diff-section {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
    }
    .diff-inner {
      max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 72px 24px;
    }
    .diff-inner .section-label { color: #888; }
    .diff-inner h2 { color: var(--paper); margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .diff-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .diff-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .diff-col { padding: 32px; }
    .diff-col.bad {
      background: #1a1a1a;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg) 0 0 var(--radius-lg);
    }
    .diff-col.good {
      background: #1e2f5e;
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) 0;
    }
    .diff-col-label {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: block;
    }
    .diff-col.bad .diff-col-label { color: #666; }
    .diff-col.good .diff-col-label { color: #7ea8ff; }
    .diff-item {
      display: flex; gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .diff-col.bad .diff-item { color: #777; }
    .diff-col.good .diff-item { color: #d4e1ff; }
    .diff-item-icon { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

    /* ── KOMPONEN ── */
    .component-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(380px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .component-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .component-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .component-header {
      background: var(--paper-warm);
      padding: 24px 28px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .component-num {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-muted);
      letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .component-header h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .component-header p {
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .component-body { padding: 24px 28px; }
    .feature-list { list-style: none; }
    .feature-list li {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;
      font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .feature-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .feature-list li::before {
      content: '→';
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }
    .component-example {
      background: var(--paper-warm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .component-example strong { color: var(--ink-soft); }

    /* ── INDUSTRI ── */
    .industry-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .industry-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
    .industry-card {
      background: var(--paper-warm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 20px 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .industry-icon { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .industry-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .industry-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-muted); }

    /* ── FOR WHOM ── */
    .persona-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .persona-card {
      background: var(--paper-warm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
    .persona-card .avatar {
      width: 40px; height: 40px;
      background: var(--accent-light);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .persona-card h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .persona-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── PRICING ── */
    .pricing-section {
      background: var(--paper-warm);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .pricing-inner {
      max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 72px 24px;
    }
    .pricing-card {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 40px;
      max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto 0;
      position: relative;
    }
    .pricing-tag {
      position: absolute; top: -14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
      padding: 4px 20px; border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .pricing-amount {
      text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .pricing-amount .price {
      font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
    }
    .pricing-amount .period {
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-muted);
      display: block; margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .pricing-compare {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      padding-bottom: 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .pricing-compare del { color: #bbb; }
    .pricing-includes { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .pricing-includes h4 {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink-muted); letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .include-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      font-size: 14px; padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .include-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .include-check { color: #22a06b; font-weight: 700; }
    .btn-buy {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
      padding: 16px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
      display: block;
      transition: transform .15s, box-shadow .15s;
    }
    .btn-buy:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.2); }
    .btn-buy-sub {
      text-align: center; font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-muted); margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .pricing-anchor {
      text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .anchor-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px; max-width: 480px; margin: 20px auto 0;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .anchor-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .anchor-item {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px 12px; text-align: center;
    }
    .anchor-item .anchor-price {
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;
      display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .anchor-item .anchor-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-muted); }
    .anchor-item.highlight {
      border-color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
    }
    .anchor-item.highlight .anchor-desc { color: #aaa; }

    /* ── FAQ ── */
    .faq-list { max-width: 640px; }
    .faq-item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 24px 0;
    }
    .faq-item h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .faq-item p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.7; }

    /* ── FINAL CTA ── */
    .final-cta {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }
    .final-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }
    .final-cta p { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 32px; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 32px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-muted);
    }
    footer a { color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    /* ── UTILS ── */
    .text-center { text-align: center; }
    .mt-8 { margin-top: 8px; }
    .mt-16 { margin-top: 16px; }
    .mt-40 { margin-top: 40px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav>
    <a href="https://sobatpm.sekolahmu.net/skillclaude/" class="nav-logo">⟨<span>S</span>⟩ SkillClaude.id</a>
    <a href="#beli" class="nav-cta">Beli Sekarang →</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">PRO · PM Intelligence Pack</div>
    <h1>
      Sistem kerja PM yang<br/>
      <em>sudah dipikirkan</em> untukmu
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Bukan template kosong yang harus kamu isi sendiri.<br/>
      Ini sistem kerja lengkap dari pengalaman nyata di 4 industri berbeda —
      PRD Generator, Research Synthesis, Stakeholder Deck, Competitor Framework.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#beli" class="btn-primary">Dapatkan Sekarang — Rp 350.000 →</a>
      <a href="#komponen" class="btn-secondary">Lihat isinya dulu ↓</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-proof">
      <span class="proof-item">Notion template siap pakai</span>
      <span class="proof-item">Contoh nyata, bukan fiktif</span>
      <span class="proof-item">4 komponen dalam 1 sistem</span>
      <span class="proof-item">Update seumur hidup</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="sep"></div>

  <!-- PROBLEM -->
  <section class="section">
    <p class="section-label">Masalah yang kamu hadapi</p>
    <h2>PM yang bagus tahu <em>apa</em> yang harus dikerjakan.<br/>Tapi sering stuck di <em>bagaimana</em>.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Bukan karena tidak kompeten. Tapi karena tidak ada sistem yang bisa langsung dipakai —
      semua harus dibangun dari nol, setiap kali.
    </p>
    <div class="pain-grid">
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="icon">📄</div>
        <h3>PRD yang tidak pernah benar-benar selesai</h3>
        <p>Selalu ada yang kurang — scope-nya blur, metric-nya tidak ada baseline, stakeholder bingung cara bacanya.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="icon">📊</div>
        <h3>Data riset yang tidak bisa di-present</h3>
        <p>Sudah interview 10 orang, sudah ada survey, ada analytics — tapi bagaimana cara nyambungkannya jadi satu insight?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="icon">🎯</div>
        <h3>Deck stakeholder yang tidak meyakinkan</h3>
        <p>Konten sudah ada, tapi setiap kali presentasi selalu ada saja yang "perlu direvisi dulu" atau "kurang ini".</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Analisis kompetitor yang dangkal</h3>
        <p>Buka website kompetitor, screenshot beberapa hal, taruh di spreadsheet — tapi tidak tahu apa kesimpulannya.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DIFFERENTIATOR -->
  <div class="diff-section">
    <div class="diff-inner">
      <p class="section-label">Kenapa beli, padahal bisa prompt AI sendiri?</p>
      <h2 style="color: var(--paper); max-width: 540px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        Bisa. Tapi kamu akan spending 40 jam iterasi yang sudah kami bayar duluan.
      </h2>
      <div class="diff-grid">
        <div class="diff-col bad">
          <span class="diff-col-label">Prompt AI sendiri dari nol</span>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✗</span> Mulai dari prompt generik, hasilnya juga generik</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✗</span> Harus iterasi berkali-kali baru dapat output yang benar</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✗</span> Tidak tahu standar "PRD yang baik" seperti apa</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✗</span> Contoh yang dibuat AI tidak punya konteks industri nyata</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✗</span> Tiap orang di tim punya versi berbeda</div>
        </div>
        <div class="diff-col good">
          <span class="diff-col-label">PM Intelligence Pack</span>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✓</span> Framework sudah dikurasi dari 4 industri — langsung pakai</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✓</span> Semua keputusan struktur sudah dibuat, kamu tinggal isi konten</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✓</span> Ada standar jelas: checklist, scoring, panduan keputusan</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✓</span> Contoh nyata dari Ecommerce, Edtech, Fintech, Kementerian</div>
          <div class="diff-item"><span class="diff-item-icon">✓</span> Tim bisa align karena pakai sistem yang sama</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- KOMPONEN -->
  <section class="section" id="komponen">
    <p class="section-label">Isi produk</p>
    <h2>4 komponen, 1 sistem terpadu</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Setiap komponen bisa dipakai terpisah, tapi dirancang untuk bekerja bersama —
      dari riset ke PRD ke presentasi ke analisis kompetitor.
    </p>
    <div class="component-grid">

      <div class="component-card">
        <div class="component-header">
          <p class="component-num">KOMPONEN 01</p>
          <h3>🧩 PRD Generator</h3>
          <p>Dari brief singkat jadi PRD lengkap yang siap di-review tim engineering, design, dan stakeholder — tanpa ada yang kurang.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="component-body">
          <ul class="feature-list">
            <li>Layer 1: 7 pertanyaan diagnosis wajib sebelum nulis — eliminasi asumsi dari awal</li>
            <li>Layer 2: Struktur PRD lengkap 9 section dengan contoh nyata ecommerce</li>
            <li>User stories dalam format Given/When/Then, bukan placeholder kosong</li>
            <li>Risk matrix dengan kolom mitigasi yang actionable</li>
            <li>Layer 3: Self-review checklist 14 poin dengan scoring — PM tahu kapan PRD-nya benar-benar siap</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="component-example">
            <strong>Contoh nyata:</strong> Cart abandonment feature di platform ecommerce — dari problem statement sampai acceptance criteria edge cases.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="component-card">
        <div class="component-header">
          <p class="component-num">KOMPONEN 02</p>
          <h3>🔬 Research Synthesis Engine</h3>
          <p>Ubah data mentah dari interview, survey, dan analytics menjadi insight yang bisa langsung diputuskan — bukan sekadar ringkasan.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="component-body">
          <ul class="feature-list">
            <li>Tahap 0: Audit data dengan standar minimum aman per sumber — tahu kapan data cukup</li>
            <li>Strukturisasi terpisah untuk interview, survey, dan analytics</li>
            <li>Cross-source Evidence Mapping: temukan insight yang tidak bisa ditemukan dari satu sumber saja</li>
            <li>Framework identifikasi kontradiksi antar sumber — yang paling sering dilewati PM</li>
            <li>Impact × Confidence matrix untuk prioritisasi — output berupa keputusan, bukan daftar temuan</li>
            <li>Research report 1 halaman siap share ke stakeholder</li>
          </ul>
